<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Account Deletion Instructions</h1>
        
        <p>At CallKardo, we respect your privacy and data rights. If you wish to permanently delete your account and associated data, you can do so by following the methods outlined below.</p>

        <h2>Method 1: Delete via the App (Recommended)</h2>
        <div class="step">
            <h3>Step 1</h3>
            <p>Open the CallKardo mobile app and log in to your account.</p>
            <h3>Step 2</h3>
            <p>Navigate to <strong>Settings</strong> or your <strong>Profile</strong> section from the main menu.</p>
            <h3>Step 3</h3>
            <p>Scroll down and tap on <strong>Account Settings</strong>.</p>
            <h3>Step 4</h3>
            <p>Select <strong>Delete Account</strong> and follow the on-screen prompts to confirm.</p>
        </div>

        <h2>Method 2: Request Deletion via Email</h2>
        <div class="step">
            <p>If you no longer have access to the app, you can request account deletion by contacting our support team.</p>
            <p>Send an email to <strong>support@sunrasofttech.com</strong> from the email address registered with your CallKardo account.</p>
            <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Account Deletion Request</p>
            <p>Please include your full name and registered phone number in the body of the email to help us locate your account faster.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="alert">
            <strong>Important Notice:</strong> 
            Account deletion is permanent and irreversible. Once your account is deleted, all your data, including call logs, AI agent configurations, sub-accounts, and active subscriptions will be permanently erased. Any remaining wallet balance or credits will be forfeited.
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
